@title Reports list: counts arrive after the workspace opens, never from an earlier state
@area Reports
# The list opens at once with dashes; the row counts fill in when the worker answers. The picture is
# taken with no wait after the click; on the small example the worker may already be done, so the
# dashes are guaranteed only by the unit test (reports_view.rs), and the 600-page project shows them.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Reports #2
shot counts-pending
check_layout
wait 40
shot counts-arrived
check_blank counts-arrived
check_layout
